Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 xserver-xorg-video-nvidia-legacy-390xx (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-dkms (= ${binary:Version}),
Recommends:
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-390xx-glx,
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver metapackage (Fermi, Kepler (GeForce 400/500/600/700 series))
 The 390.157 driver from the NVIDIA 390xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for focal.
 .
 Supported hardware: Fermi, Kepler (GeForce 400/500/600/700 series).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2022-12. Community-patched for newer kernels/Xorg.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 390.157 driver.

Package: libgl1-nvidia-legacy-390xx-glx
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version})
Provides: libgl1-nvidia-glx
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — libGL / GLX
 The NVIDIA implementation of libGL and the GLX extension for the 390.157
 driver, wired through glvnd where the distro provides it.

Package: xserver-xorg-video-nvidia-legacy-390xx
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-390xx-glx (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
Provides: xorg-driver-video
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — Xorg driver
 The nvidia_drv.so X.Org video driver from the 390.157 release.
 Officially targets X server video driver ABI <= 25.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-vdpau-driver
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: vdpau-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — VDPAU backend
 libvdpau_nvidia.so, the VDPAU hardware video acceleration backend.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — core runtime libraries
 Every remaining shared library from the NVIDIA 390.157 userspace (the ones
 not split into the -glx / -vdpau packages): libnvidia-glcore, libnvidia-tls,
 libnvidia-eglcore, libnvidia-ml, libcuda and friends. Install the :i386
 variant alongside for 32-bit applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-support
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-support-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 390.157 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-dkms
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 3.0.3)
Recommends: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs
Provides: nvidia-legacy-390xx-kernel-MODULE
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — DKMS kernel module source
 DKMS source for the nvidia, nvidia-modeset, nvidia-drm and nvidia-uvm kernel
 modules from the 390.157 release. Rebuilt automatically for every installed
 kernel (Debian, Ubuntu HWE, mainline PPA and Ubuntu kernel PPA).
 Community patches extend build support to Linux <= 7.2.
